OL,3,AE-bike and e-scooter battery fires
OL,4,Acause of 18 deaths and nearly 700
OL,5,Ainjuries
OL,6,
OL,7,FEighteen people have died and nearly
OL,8,F700 have been injured in fires caused
OL,9,Fby e-bikes and e-scooters, new data
OL,10,Fshows.
OL,12,FFatalities recorded by fire and rescue
OL,13,Fservices across the UK from these fires
OL,14,Finclude cases where people became
OL,15,Ftrapped inside burning homes, died
OL,16,Fwhile trying to escape from a fire out
OL,17,Fof a high window, or from inhaling
OL,18,Ftoxic smoke.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
