OL,3,AE-bike and e-scooter battery fires
OL,4,Acause of 18 deaths and nearly 700
OL,5,Ainjuries
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 2,000 fires were started by
OL,8,Fe-bikes, e-scooters or their batteries
OL,9,Fbetween 2019 and 2025, Freedom of
OL,10,FInformation requests made by BBC Verify
OL,11,Fshow.
OL,13,FThe number of incidents has risen
OL,14,Fyear-on-year and nearly half the fires
OL,15,Fstarted in homes or garages, the data
OL,16,Fshows.
